:: D00_Evening [nobr]
<<HUD>>

<<SceneDivider "Home, Evening">>

<div class="prose-block">

<p>I heat water on the stovetop, the microwave died three weeks ago, another casualty in the ongoing war between my life and basic functionality, and pour it over instant ramen. The noodles soften in the styrofoam cup. I sit on the couch. It&apos;s secondhand, stained in places I choose not to investigate, and sags in the middle like it gave up on posture around the same time I did.</p>

<p>I eat and stare at the eviction notice sitting on the coffee table. Seven days. I have seven days to come up with $1,300 or lose the apartment. Where does someone with $47 in their checking account find $1,300?</p>

<p>I dig the flyer out of my pocket, unfold it, smooth the creases against my thigh.</p>

<p>$2,000. One visit. One pill.</p>

<p>Worst case, it&apos;s shady and the pill makes me sick for a week. I&apos;ve been sick before. I ate gas station sushi once and lived through it. A pharmaceutical trial can&apos;t be worse than gas station sushi.</p>

<p>Best case, I walk in, swallow a vitamin, walk out with two thousand dollars, pay rent, and buy real food for the first time in a month.</p>

<p>I pick up my phone, dial the number, and let my thumb hover over the call button for a beat.</p>

<p>Two rings, then someone picks up.</p>

<<Dialogue "NovaCure Intake" "☎️" "NovaCure Laboratories, participant intake. How can I help you?" "">>

<<Dialogue "You" "🙂" "Hi, I... I saw the flyer. On campus. About the trial." "you">>

<<Dialogue "NovaCure Intake" "☎️" "Of course. Can I get your name and age?" "">>

<<Dialogue "You" "🙂" "Marcus Cole. Twenty." "you">>

<<Dialogue "NovaCure Intake" "☎️" "Any current medications, Mr. Cole?" "">>

<<Dialogue "You" "🙂" "No." "you">>

<<Dialogue "NovaCure Intake" "☎️" "Known allergies?" "">>

<<Dialogue "You" "🙂" "No." "you">>

<<Dialogue "NovaCure Intake" "☎️" "Wonderful. We have availability tonight at 8:30 PM. Can you make it?" "">>

<p>Tonight. I glance at the clock on the stove. 6:47 PM. &quot;Tonight?&quot;</p>

<<Dialogue "NovaCure Intake" "☎️" "Compensation is processed same-day. Direct deposit. Most of our participants appreciate the promptness." "">>

<p>Same-day deposit, in my account before midnight. I could pay Mrs. Park before breakfast tomorrow.</p>

<<Dialogue "You" "🙂" "I'll be there." "you">>

<p>She gives me the address. Meridian Tower, 6th floor, Suite 604. Check in at reception, bring valid ID. &quot;Is there anything else I can help with?&quot;</p>

<p>&quot;What does the pill actually do? Like, what&apos;s it for?&quot;</p>

<<Dialogue "NovaCure Intake" "☎️" "Dr. Amelia will explain the trial parameters when you arrive. It's a very standard process, Mr. Cole." "">>

<p>Standard. Sure. Everything about this call has sounded standard. I hang up, sit back down, and eat my instant ramen telling myself it&apos;s fine. It&apos;s a pill. One pill. It&apos;s fine.</p>

<p>I finish the ramen, wash the fork, and stare out the window at the darkening street. The decision feels small, small enough that it barely registers against the weight of everything else, and I have no idea yet that it might be the biggest one I&apos;ll ever make.</p>

</div>

<div class="choice-block">
	<<link '<span>🧥 Get ready to head out</span>' "Home">>
		<<set $timeslot to "Night">>
		<<set $player.energy to Math.clamp($player.energy - 15, 0, 100)>>
		<<set $calledNovaCure to true>>
		<<run window.rbAddJournalEntry("The Call", "I called the number on the flyer. They have an opening tonight at 8:30 PM. Meridian Tower, Suite 604. Compensation processed same-day.")>>
	<</link>>
</div>
